<http://orkg.org/orkg/predicate/P119129> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\"classes\" refer to the categories or labels that a model tries to predict based on the input data. These categories can represent different classes, groups, or outcomes, depending on the nature of the problem being solved." .
