<http://orkg.org/orkg/predicate/P123003> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "NLP Tasks for evaluation" .
<http://orkg.org/orkg/predicate/P123004> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://orkg.org/orkg/class/Predicate> .
