<http://orkg.org/orkg/predicate/P128007> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Defines wether endogenous and exogenous predictors (independent variable) were used as input in the model, or defines some characteristics related to simultaneous usage of those both types of predictors" .
