<http://orkg.org/orkg/predicate/P128008> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Defines wether multioutput model (model with output in the form of vector, not single output) or chain model (output in the form of multiple single outputs predicted in chain manner) was applied or defines some characteristics related to them" .
