<http://orkg.org/orkg/predicate/P128009> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Defines wether mean absolute error and (or at least 'or') root mean square error were applied in the research in order to estimate model performance. Both error measures are absolute measures (have unit of predicted variable) and are quite important and widely used" .
<http://orkg.org/orkg/predicate/P128009> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "absolute performance metrics - mean absolute error and/or root mean square error" .
