<http://orkg.org/orkg/predicate/P128010> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Defines wether coefficient of determination and (or at least 'or') Nash-Sutcliffe efficiency were applied in the research in order to estimate model performance. Both error measures are relative measures (unit is dimensionless) and are quite important and widely used" .
<http://orkg.org/orkg/predicate/P128010> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "relative performance metrics - coefficient of determination and/or Nash-Sutcliffe efficiency " .
