<http://orkg.org/orkg/predicate/P128012> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
<http://orkg.org/orkg/predicate/P128012> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Defines wether modeled (predicted) values are visually compared in dependence of observed values on the graph (usually called 'scatter graph', with observed values on x-axis and predicted values on y-axis), or some characteristics related to the comparison" .
<http://orkg.org/orkg/predicate/P128012> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "model vs. observations" .
<http://orkg.org/orkg/predicate/P128013> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://orkg.org/orkg/class/Predicate> .
