<http://orkg.org/orkg/predicate/P128013> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Defines wether model for prediction of tide (sea) levels was verified/tested on some specific observed high tide events, or property may include some analysis and characteristics related to high tides" .
