<http://orkg.org/orkg/predicate/P128015> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Defines wether model for prediction of water levels (or discharges) was verified/tested on some specific observed high water events, or property may include some analysis and characteristics related to high water events (floods)" .
