<http://orkg.org/orkg/predicate/P142015> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Symbolic representation captures the essence of how knowledge is encoded and communicated within a given domain. It signifies the capacity to translate real-world phenomena into a structured format that can be understood, processed, and manipulated by both humans and machines" .
<http://orkg.org/orkg/predicate/P142015> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Symbolic Representation" .
