<http://orkg.org/orkg/predicate/P142017> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Artificial intelligence systems are considered trustworthy when they adhere to ethical principles, exhibit transparency in their decision-making processes, mitigate biases, ensure privacy and security, and provide mechanisms for accountability and oversight." .
<http://orkg.org/orkg/predicate/P142017> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Trustworthiness" .
<http://orkg.org/orkg/predicate/P142018> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://orkg.org/orkg/class/Predicate> .
