<http://orkg.org/orkg/predicate/P142018> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Explainability, refers to the ability to understand and interpret the decisions, predictions, or behaviors of AI systems in a manner that is transparent, comprehensible, and intuitive to humans." .
<http://orkg.org/orkg/predicate/P142018> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Explainability" .
<http://orkg.org/orkg/predicate/P142019> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://orkg.org/orkg/class/Predicate> .
