<http://orkg.org/orkg/predicate/P15700> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "End of temporal extent" .
<http://orkg.org/orkg/predicate/P15700> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has end" .
<http://orkg.org/orkg/predicate/P15701> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://orkg.org/orkg/class/Predicate> .
<http://orkg.org/orkg/predicate/P15701> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
<http://orkg.org/orkg/predicate/P15701> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "upper limit" .
<http://orkg.org/orkg/predicate/P15702> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://orkg.org/orkg/class/Predicate> .
