<http://orkg.org/orkg/predicate/P15702> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "lower limit" .
<http://orkg.org/orkg/predicate/P158000> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://orkg.org/orkg/class/Predicate> .
<http://orkg.org/orkg/predicate/P158000> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
<http://orkg.org/orkg/predicate/P158000> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The University predicate specifies the educational institution or research institution affiliated with the research conducted in the paper." .
<http://orkg.org/orkg/predicate/P158000> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "University" .
<http://orkg.org/orkg/predicate/P158001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://orkg.org/orkg/class/Predicate> .
<http://orkg.org/orkg/predicate/P158001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
<http://orkg.org/orkg/predicate/P158001> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The level or qualification obtained by an individual in a given field of study, typically indicating their educational achievement or expertise. " .
<http://orkg.org/orkg/predicate/P158001> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "degree" .
<http://orkg.org/orkg/predicate/P158002> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://orkg.org/orkg/class/Predicate> .
<http://orkg.org/orkg/predicate/P158002> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
<http://orkg.org/orkg/predicate/P158002> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The predicate 'Military Service Risk Factors' describes the specific factors or conditions that increase the likelihood of mental ill health and impact functional capability in UK Army Personnel. These risk factors are identified and analyzed in the research paper to understand the gender differences and their effects on military personnel's well-being over their service duration." .
<http://orkg.org/orkg/predicate/P158002> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Military Service Risk Factors" .
<http://orkg.org/orkg/predicate/P158003> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://orkg.org/orkg/class/Predicate> .
<http://orkg.org/orkg/predicate/P158003> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
<http://orkg.org/orkg/predicate/P158003> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Post Service Risk Factors is a research predicate that identifies and explores the factors that contribute to the risk of mental ill health and functional capability in UK Army personnel after their service period. It aims to investigate the specific elements that may impact the well-being and performance of individuals who have served in the UK Army." .
<http://orkg.org/orkg/predicate/P158003> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Post Service Risk Factors" .
<http://orkg.org/orkg/predicate/P158004> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://orkg.org/orkg/class/Predicate> .
<http://orkg.org/orkg/predicate/P158004> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
<http://orkg.org/orkg/predicate/P158004> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The optimization task is the main focus of the research paper and involves optimizing resource management for server virtualization under the constraints of recovery time objectives." .
