<http://orkg.org/orkg/predicate/P160004> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "OWL support refers to the extent to which the research paper incorporates or utilizes the Web Ontology Language (OWL) for modeling and representing knowledge in the field of interest. It signifies the use of OWL to define classes, properties, and relationships between entities, enabling semantic data integration and reasoning within the research context." .
<http://orkg.org/orkg/predicate/P160004> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "OWL support" .
