<http://orkg.org/orkg/predicate/P160010> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "SPARQL compatibility refers to the extent to which a software tool or system is able to work effectively with SPARQL, a query language for querying RDF data. In the context of research contributions, claiming SPARQL compatibility indicates support for querying RDF data and interoperability with other Semantic Web tools and datasets." .
<http://orkg.org/orkg/predicate/P160010> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "SPARQL compability" .
