<http://orkg.org/orkg/predicate/P160011> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The web interface predicate indicates the development or utilization of a user interface that is accessed through a web browser. This interface may involve interactive elements, data visualization, user input forms, or other functionalities that enable users to interact with web-based resources or services." .
<http://orkg.org/orkg/predicate/P160011> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Web interface" .
