<http://orkg.org/orkg/predicate/P160013> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Automated Error Detection is a research predicate that signifies the development and implementation of algorithms, tools, or systems that are capable of automatically identifying errors, mistakes, or anomalies in data, processes, or systems without human intervention. This property is used to describe research contributions that focus on the advancement of automated error detection methods in various scientific domains." .
<http://orkg.org/orkg/predicate/P160013> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Automated Error Detection" .
