<http://orkg.org/orkg/predicate/P177058> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "expresses that a particular study design, method, or feature enhances the extent to which the results of a study can be applied to broader or more diverse populations beyond the original study sample." .
<http://orkg.org/orkg/predicate/P177058> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "improves Generalizability" .
<http://orkg.org/orkg/predicate/P177059> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://orkg.org/orkg/class/Predicate> .
