<http://orkg.org/orkg/predicate/P177060> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "is used to specify known drawbacks, constraints, or weaknesses associated with a study design, method, or resource. " .
<http://orkg.org/orkg/predicate/P177060> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has Limitation" .
