<http://orkg.org/orkg/predicate/P188034> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "lazy thinking heuristics for peer reviews which correspond to superficial, unsupported, or heuristic-based critique patterns that lack proper reasoning or evidence. These aspects are derived from ARR 2022 and EMNLP 2020 reviewing guidelines and are explicitly annotated in the dataset." .
<http://orkg.org/orkg/predicate/P188034> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "lazy review aspects" .
